Optimized Approach (Frequency Count – BEST)
🔹 Logic

Ek array lo size 26 (sirf lowercase letters)

s ke characters increment karo

t ke characters decrement karo

Agar kahi bhi value negative ho → not anagram

public class ValidAnagramOptimized {
    public static boolean isAnagram(String s, String t) {

        if (s.length() != t.length()) return false;

        int[] freq = new int[26];

        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {
            freq[s.charAt(i) - 'a']++;
            freq[t.charAt(i) - 'a']--;
        }

        for (int count : freq) {
            if (count != 0) return false;
        }

        return true;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(isAnagram("rat", "tar")); // true
    }
}
Complexity

Time: O(n) ✅

Space: O(1) ✅

